Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/rhecht/jewbuntu-skin

Package: jewbuntu-skin
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-user-theme
Description: Jewbuntu Skin - Mac-inspired GTK and GNOME Shell theme
 Glass-style GTK 2/3/4 and GNOME Shell theme for Jewbuntu (light and dark,
 normal and solid, HiDPI variants), based on the MacTahoe theme (MIT), plus
 the Jewbuntu wallpapers in Settings > Appearance.
 .
 Installing the package changes nothing by itself; 'jewbuntu skin apply'
 (from jewbuntu-core) switches an account to it and can undo the change.
